<title>USA: Stratus says names Bruce Sachs president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Stratus says names Bruce Sachs president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MARLBORO, Mass. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stratus Computer Inc said Monday Bruce Sachs was named president, chief executive and a member of the board.</p>
<p>The company said Sachs replaces founder and current chief executive Bill Foster, who remains chairman of the board and will serve as an outside director.</p>
<p>Sachs was previously at Bay Networks Inc, where he was executive vice president and general manager for the Internet Telecom Business Group.</p>
